      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123225793405083754",
      "text": "So Steven Adams just got knocked down and Braden Smith might have had something to do with it. Adams gets up and walks towards Smith. Nesmith pushes him back. Smith holds his ground. Everybody gets separated. They're going to watch this on video.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DustinDopirak/status/2123225793405083754",
