      "text": "Rockets up 62-46 at the half. Pacers 19 of 43 from the floor, 5 of 17 from 3, 3 of 4 at the line, 0.92 per possession. Rockets 24 of 51, 11 of 22, 3 of 6, 1.24 per possession. Siakam nine points, McConnell 8, Jabari Smith 12, Durant 11",
